
=== 1. lem:ex:chainsemi / eq:ex:depth with z NOT restricted to nonzero d-bit strings
F == 0^d, x=01: number of z of length <= 5 (any d-bit strings) with F ⊇ D(x,z): 6 (Lemma claims <= 1)
k=1: N-k=3 | max_F count, z restricted to nonzero d-bit: 3 | z unrestricted: 3
k=2: N-k=2 | max_F count, z restricted to nonzero d-bit: 2 | z unrestricted: 3
k=3: N-k=1 | max_F count, z restricted to nonzero d-bit: 1 | z unrestricted: 3

=== 2. Eisenstat constants (prop:ex:asymp, prop:ex:burnin, prop:ex:rulestats)
H(1/3)/2 = 0.4591479 ; sigma^2 = 1.0496602 ; sigma = 1.0245 ; iid(1/3) rate log3-1/3 = 1.2516
vartheta = 0.7995167363 ; 3*vartheta = 2.39855021
return probability from touching = 0.666666666667 (paper 2/3)
no-error probability p solves p = p/3 + 1/3 -> 1/2
E B-steps after a touching step ~ 0.333333333333 (paper 1/3); errors per cycle = 2/9+1/9+1/3 = 2/3
Lemma behind constant 1+1/(1-e^{-1/18}) = 19.5046 (paper <= 19.6)
T=1 G=0: UB - tau*H = -0.333333 ; (2/3)(G-T/2) = -0.333333
T=3 G=5: UB - tau*H = 2.333333 ; (2/3)(G-T/2) = 2.333333
T=10 G=2: UB - tau*H = -2.000000 ; (2/3)(G-T/2) = -2.000000

